models accept created objects (ReLU(), not ReLU)
forward accepts prepared input (use x = prepare() before if needed)
prepare() is a separate function
loss must be queried after forward() or predict()
passed x must not be changed (no x = 1, later x = 2)
x and y are saved in forward, but not in backward
forward() and predict() store x and y
class Parameterless defines from_obj and to_obj
